 ’o\, with Zendaya and Charlize Theron. This is the page for digital pres
 entations of The Odyssey. For 70mm showtimes\, visit this page.  **The B
 alcony is not accessible by elevator.**\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/cinema/in-
 theaters/the-odyssey\n\nEstimated start: 19:15
