 ssionist landscape of sunny blossoms\, a blissful husband and wife (Jean-C
 laude and Claire Drouot) picnic on the grass. Their happiness feels organi
 cally grown\, part of the natural order. But when Jean-Claude meets a post
 al clerk (Marie-France Boyer)\, he realizes he has a capacity for “more 
 flowers\, more apples.”\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/programs-and-events/nouv
 elles-femmes/le-bonheur-(happiness)\n\nEstimated start: 19:45
